                <img src="/projects/re-diseno-la-cometa/assets/img/obra-a-land-reform-19.webp" alt="«A land reform 19», obra sobre papel de Camilo Restrepo, 208 × 189 cm" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </figure>
              <h3 class="lc-card__title mt-3">A land reform 19</h3>
